風歸服，惟零陵太守郝普城守不降。而備自蜀親至公安，遣羽爭三郡。權時住陸口，使魯肅萬人屯益陽拒羽，而飛書召蒙，使捨零陵，急還助肅。初，蒙既定長沙，當之零陵，過酃，載南陽鄧玄之，玄之者郝普之舊也，欲令誘普。及被書當還，蒙秘之。夜召諸將，授以方畧，晨當攻城。顧謂玄之曰：","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line070:m0047"}],"attestations":[{"id":"t-wu054-t-wu054-lvmeng11:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line070","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-054-lvmeng:line070:m0047","start":43,"end":47,"surface":"零陵太守","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"human_reviewed":false,"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-appraisal:line089","text":"　　評曰：曹公乘漢相之資，挾天子而掃群桀，新蕩荊城，仗威東夏，於時議者莫不疑貳。周瑜、魯肅建獨斷之明出眾人之表，實奇才也。呂蒙勇而有謀，斷識軍計，譎郝普，禽關羽，最其妙者。初雖輕果妄殺，終於克己，有國士之量，豈徒武將而已乎！孫權之論，優劣允當，故載錄焉。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-appraisal:line089:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"曹公","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_b77_b38","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-appraisal:line089:m0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"天子","kind":"person","person_id":"e49_8a5_738","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-appraisal:line089:m0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"周瑜","kind":"person","person_id":"f56_938_997","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-appraisal:line089:m0043","start":43,"end":45,"surface":"魯肅","kind":"person","person_id":"ooa_1fr_hy9","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-appraisal:line089:m0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"呂蒙","kind":"person","person_id":"ibt_i7u_ykp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-054-appraisal:line089:m0074","start":74,"end":76,"surface":"郝普","kind":"p